/**
 * PHU-QUOC PHOTOGRAPHY — generated by scripts/fetch-destination-images.mjs.
 *
 * Sources: Wikimedia Commons (places, areas, a few properties) and Openverse
 * (Flickr and other CC repositories, which is where hotel interior photography
 * tends to live). Every image carries its licence, author and source page, and
 * the UI renders that credit. Licences are restricted to those permitting
 * commercial use — no NC or ND.
 *
 * HOTELS: a hotel only has images if they were verified to be THAT property —
 * either by membership of its Commons category (whose name must itself name the
 * property) or by the property name appearing in the file title together with a
 * Bali locality. A hotel with no verified photography has no entry here and the
 * card says "No property photography available". It never borrows its area photo,
 * because that would imply a beach is the hotel.
 *
 * `depicts` records what a photo shows — pool, room, beach, dining, exterior — and
 * drives gallery variety so two images of one hotel are not two of the same thing.
 *
 * Subjects and their verification rules: scripts/images/subjects/phu-quoc.mjs
 * Regenerate: npm run images:resolve -- --destination phu-quoc && npm run images:download -- --destination phu-quoc
 */

